        "message": {
          "content": "A\n\nWhat ultimately gives existence value is the quality of conscious experience. If a choice guarantees a lifetime maximized for joy, love, fulfillment, and peace, while eliminating profound suffering and despair, it delivers the greatest possible amount of net happiness. Because the experiences feel entirely real to the person living them, entering produces far more overall well-being than a reality constrained by inevitable pain and unrealized potential.",
